      "text": "TRAFFIC ADVISORY: OBSERVE ROAD CLOSURE along G. Lazaro Street and EXPECT MERGING TRAFFIC along MacArthur Highway to NLEX Segment Service Road up to C.J. Santos Street, starting at 3:00 AM onwards on March 29, 2026, to make way for the participants of the scheduled Fun Run event.\n\nAdditionally, C.J. Santos Steet will be CLOSED TO TRAFFIC from 12:00 PM on March 28, 2026 until 1:00 PM on March 29, 2026 to make way for the Zumba Event.\n\nPlease take alternate route.",
